            "bio": "Louis oversees all hotels and activities, from the creation of partnerships through to the opening and operating of each property for Ennismore in the Middle East, Africa and Turkey region.\n\nIn addition to his regional role, Louis has recently been promoted to Chief Development Officer and also lead the growth of Ennismore branded residential business globally.\n\nPrior to joining Ennismore, Louis was VP of Development, Middle East at Accor. Louis began his career in operations with Starwood Hotels and Resorts in California, before moving back to the region to work in Asset Management for the Saudi Bin Ladin Group in Jeddah and Majid Al Futtaim in Dubai. Louis also engaged with consultancy first HVS as  part of its Consulting and Valuations practice in Dubai.\n",
