            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Managing Director",
            "bio": "Sisban’s COO & Managing Director GCC, Tariq is a highly recognized business leader in Saudi Arabia, with more than 24 years of practical experience in investments and working in the private sector.\n\nTariq serves as a non-executive director on multiple boards of major Saudi companies which operate in different sectors including real estate, Hajj & Umrah, hospitality, engineering and contracting companies. He is also heavily involved in the media and sport sectors, having been CEO of Saudi Al-Hilal Football Club and held senior positions in The Saudi Arabian Football Federation.\n\nHaving trained in strategic planning and quality assurance, Tariq has special responsibility for the remarkable impacts of Sisban’s investment portfolio, both within Saudi Arabia and internationally.\nTariq holds a Bachelor’s degree in Mechanical Engineering from King Saud University in Riyadh.\n",
            "id": 2994086
