            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Chief Executive Officer, Engineering Sector",
            "bio": "Abdullah Ali Abdullah AlZahrani is the CEO of Engineering Sector, Saeed Raddad Group (SRG) which mainly covering SRACO Construction, SRACO Industrial Services, MANIFA Petroleum Services Company & SARI Precast Factory.\n\nThe Engineering Sector in SRG plays key role in the major projects that have been implemented within the Kingdom, where it has carried out many construction and maintenance projects in the public and private sectors. Visioning full business expansion and delivering quality services in other Gulf Countries within the GCC. \n\nAbdullah was responsible in introducing acquisition of large complex industrial projects from prominent Clients who choose and preferred an Engineer-Procure-Construct (EPC) method which require a single entity to deliver a project to turnkey status. Abdullah advocate and highlight the efficient & effective modern technology services being utilized in the waste management for oil & gas industry. Moreover, Abdullah expended the business opportunities by participating and providing adequate services delivery in Energy projects kingdom wide.\n\nAbdullah is a perfection-aiming executive professional with a 14+ years of experience in industrial procurement, facility management, operations maintenance and construction of EPC projects.\n",
            "id": 3000644
