            "firstname": "Assem",
            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Head of Real Estate",
            "bio": "Assem occupies the position of Head of Real Estate department at Al Rajhi Capital , which he joined in November 2020, leading a team specialized in managing the investments and Real Estate Funds. \n\nPrior to joining ARC, Assem, held the position of Senior Vice President at Saudi Investment Department– Real Estate & Infrastructure in The Public Investments Fund, where he contributed in establishing many investment & developmental projects, and was a member of a number of committees and boards, as a representative to the PIF. Prior to that, he held the position of Director of Real Estate Development, at JABAL OMAR DEVELOPMENT COMPANY. In addition to the above mentioned posts, he worked as the Director of Investments at METHAK INVESTMENT HOLDING, as well as Investment Manager with the SEDCO HOLDING, where he was managing the investment operations on both the local and global fronts for all types of assets. \n\nAssem, holds an M.Sc. Degree in Real Estate Finance and Investment from University of Reading in The United Kingdom, and an M.Sc. Degree in Financial Analysis and Fund Management, from University of Exeter in U.K. He obtained his B.Sc. in Finance, from King Fahad University of Petroleum and Minerals.\n",
            "id": 3001123
