            "company": "Keane Consult & Create",
            "lastname": "Clements",
            "firstname": "Charles",
            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Director -  Innovation & Growth",
            "bio": "Charles is Director – Innovation & Growth at Keane which was founded in 1995 with offices in Dubai, Birmingham and Riyadh (2023). Keane consult & create for developers, operators and brands across the globe; creating memorable moments through offer, brand & environment where people eat, stay, work and shop. Because Experience Matters \n\nCharles has 25 years’ experience in in senior roles across Operations, Commercial, Marketing, Training, Pre-Opening, Design, Development and Project Delivery in key markets across the UK, Southeast Asia and the Middle East. Charles has supported more than 80 successful openings across various territories from standalone, independent units to flagship 5* hotel properties for a broad range of partners and employers such as Fairmont Hotels & Resorts, Starwood Hotels & Resorts, Wolfgang Puck, Living Ventures, Pret A Manger, Asia Pacific Breweries, Emirates, LVMH, Heineken, Abu Dhabi Airports, Dubai Airports, Changi Airport Group, and Brown Forman.",
