            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Chief Operating Officer, Middle East",
            "bio": "Sandeep Walia is the Chief Operating Officer for Marriott International in the Middle East. With over 25 years of international experience in hospitality, Sandeep is currently responsible for the operations of Marriott’s properties in the Middle East (including Egypt and Turkey) which features over 230 operational properties and over 100 properties in its pipeline.\n\nSandeep joined Marriott International in 2005. He was previously the Area Vice President for the UAE, the company’s largest market in the Middle East. Prior to that, Sandeep was the Area Vice President - Luxury for Western Europe, overseeing the company’s luxury portfolio across multiple markets.",
