            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Investment Director",
            "bio": "Mr. Sohail Alali, The Director of Investment at Rua Al Madinah Holding Company, has many years of professional experience in the hospitality industry covering Investment, Assets Management, Business Development and Hotels Operation, during which he worked in many companies and held many positions, including the Chairman of the Board at Madinah Airport Hotel Company, The Director of Hospitality Investment at Taiba Investment Company and The director of Corporate Finance at Arab Resorts Areas Company. Mr. Sohail holds a bachelor's degree in accounting from Multimedia University in Cyberjaya – Malaysia.",
