            "bio": "Leading Meraki Restaurants is Olivier Eynard CEO and Co-Founder of Meraki. His career highlights includes working with legendary chefs such as Joel Robuchon, Paul Bocuse, Roger Verge, Gaston Lenotre. He was also the Global Operations Director for La Petite Maison and Director of International Expansions for the Arts Club.\n",
