            "firstname": "Tunji",
            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Chef",
            "bio": "Tunji Oladipo - a chef with over 20 years’ experience in restaurants with a journey that takes him from training under Michelin star master chef Gary Hollihead in Marco Pierre White’s restaurants in London to running some of Dubai’s most acclaimed restaurants. A passion for Provencal style cooking lead to the collaboration with the world famous dining institution of Antibes in the south of France, known as Mamo Michelangelo.",
