            "firstname": "Stefan ",
            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Managing Partner",
            "bio": "Stefan is Managing Partner (F&B Consulting) at Keane which was founded in 1995 with offices in Dubai, Birmingham and Riyadh (2023). Keane consult & create for developers, operators and brands across the globe; creating memorable moments through offer, brand & environment where people eat, stay, work and shop. Because Experience Matters \n  \nStefan has worked previously both as a consultant and client side where he had roles as regional F&B lead with IHG in SE Asia/ME, Hilton (Europe) and regional F&B lead at Starwood and Marriott for EMEA with over 1200 F&B venues. Stefan has over 350 F&B concepts to his name; brought brands such as Buddha Bar, Hakkasan, Pierre Gagnaire and Embassy to the ME; and had notable success at Mall of the Emirates and Yas Island.  At Keane, he is currently engaged on F&B strategy & masterplanning for many of the 'giga' projects in the Kingdom.\n",
