            "firstname": "Natasha",
            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Founder & CEO",
            "bio": "TASHA SIDERIS is the Founder & CEO of Tashas Group, a hospitality company operating out of Dubai. Under its umbrella, Tashas Group houses 8 brands: tashas, Flamingo Room by tashas, Avli by tashas, Galaxy Bar, Le Parc by tashas, Bungalo34, Collective Africa and 1701. Natasha grew up in the restaurant business, by her father’s side where she learned the important lessons of being a restauranteur. Her inspiration has come from her travels around the world - London, New York, Miami, and Monte Carlo and working with talented artisans and designers.",
