            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Product Lead – Digital Twin",
            "bio": "Mark is a digital transformation specialist in the real estate industry with over 12 years’ experience. His primary focus is on product development, revenue-generating digital services, data monetisation and disruptive technologies. In addition, he has developed corporate affiliations with Stanford University, IBM and Epic Games (specifically the Unreal Engine Visualization Team) which have been paramount in business development and internal product development efforts.\n\nPrior to his role at JLL, Mark worked on the New York City World Trade Centre redevelopment program and large-scale digital initiatives across the Middle East and Africa.\n",
