            "company": "RIKAS Hospitality Group",
            "lastname": "Kassim",
            "firstname": "Rizwan",
            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Founder & Managing Partner",
            "bio": "Rizwan Kassim is a testament to the UAE s spirit of entrepreneurship. Having started with the long-established La Canteen du Faubourg in Paris over ten years ago, the young Parisian saw a vision for the brand in Dubai and has since gone on to create the RIKAS Group, which is now one of the leading creators and operators in the Middle East dining scene.\n\nIn just eight years, he has opened a staggering nine restaurant and Beach club concepts in Dubai, many of which are now gracing the pages of the inaugural Michelin Guide and Gault milieu. With expansion underway to countries including Saudi Arabia, Greece, Europe and the US, the ambitious young entrepreneur is no stopping as he takes the RIKAS Group - home to top-name dining destinations.\n\nAside from the eight concepts, four more are under development which will hit the UAE market in 2023.",
            "id": 3013668
