            "title": "Chief Operating Officer",
            "bio": "Patrick has been in the region since 2004 and is Chief Operating Officer for Strive Services Group. Along with his team of over 900 staff, he drives the strategic and operational direction of the business.\n\nPatrick is passionate about responding to market conditions with products that meet the demanding challenges of the hospitality sector. He has over 25 years of industry experience, beginning his career at The Savoy Group Management Training Programme and later with full-time consulting roles at PKF and HVS International. \n\nStrive Services Group delivers over 20+ real estate services through its four business divisions: Home Services, Facilities Management, Managed Housing and Property Management.\n",
