            "title": "Founder & Managing Partner",
            "bio": "Ben brings an innovative problem solving approach to strategy. He is an experienced strategy professional having worked in senior roles at spacetech companies, the United Nations and policy organizations.\n\nThis has given him considerable experience at government, international organization and senior corporate levels as an advisor on strategy, policy and investment initiatives. Primarily, focused on emerging technologies, particularly space and cyber, and potential for significant economic development in the region.\n\nBen started in international law and humanitarian response in East Africa before he recognised that he could have a greater impact using his skills and experience at the strategic and policy level.\n",
