            "company": "KAFD",
            "lastname": "Webster",
            "firstname": "Steven",
            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Head of Hospitality Asset Management",
            "bio": "Originally from Vancouver, Canada, Steve brings a strong foundation in luxury hospitality combined with 15 years of asset management and portfolio investment experience across all asset classes.  With over 21 years in the Middle East, his expertise has focused on large scale mixed-use real estate development projects and investments through all stages of their project life cycle to optimize value creation.\n\nSteve joined KAFD Development & Management Company in 2019 where as the VP Portfolio Management & Asset Strategy he leads the Portfolio Performance and Investment Analysis teams with regards to all asset class strategies.  Prior to joining KAFD, Steve was an Associate Director of Asset Management at Miral and a Vice President of Real Estate in Mubadala.  He began his career with Hilton in the UK before moving back to Canada with Canadian Pacific Hotels and then relocating to Dubai in 2001 with Fairmont Hotels & Resorts.\n\nSteve holds a Bachelor of Science in Hospitality & Business Science from Manchester Metropolitan University.  His personal interests span geopolitical economics, global markets and innovative technologies reflecting on how they impact and can be integrated into hospitality and real estate developments.\n\n",
