            "title": "Industry Marketing Manager",
            "bio": "From a background of Architecture and Technology, David currently works as Industry Marketing Manager at Epic Games, responsible for overseeing Epic Games ecosystem's marketing strategy and driving marketing activities in Architecture + Real Estate.\n\nHaving worked with Architectural Engineering firms and Architectural Design consultants in the Middle East over the last decade, David’s primary focus was the adoption of new design tools into Architectural workflows and supporting the development of Digital Technologies within the Industry. David continues to support the use of Real Time Rendering throughout Architecture and Real Estate and push the boundaries on how these technologies can enhance design and bring the clients and end users closer to the design.\n",
