            "bio": "Jalil Mekouar is the Founder & CEO of inHovate (www.inHovate.com) – the hospitality industry’s first and only cloud based Intelligent Business Transformation System that empowers hotel owners and operators to realize transformative results and maximize asset value.\n\nAs an accomplished global senior executive, visionary entrepreneur, and respected thought leader, Jalil Mekouar has over 30 years of international hospitality, real estate, wellness, and technology experience in investment, finance, operations and asset management. His career as a C-suite executive spans over 35 countries in 6 continents with the world’s largest hotel operators, owners, investors, developers, advisors and asset managers.",
