            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Commercial Director",
            "bio": "Boris Mulder is a successful entrepreneur and business leader with a passion for hospitality and travel. He holds a Bachelor's degree in Hospitality Management and a Master's of Science degree in Business Administration & Finance and Investments. With over 10 years of experience in various leadership roles at Booking.com, Boris played a pivotal role in the company's growth by spearheading new business and product development.\n\nIn addition to his work at Booking.com, Boris is the founder of MyFitTrip.com, a platform that connects health and fitness enthusiasts with travel opportunities that align with their lifestyle. Currently Boris is serving as the Commercial Director at Neoke.com, a cutting-edge technology firm that specializes in digital identity innovation and transformation in travel, Boris continues to demonstrate his business acumen and leadership capabilities.\n",
