            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Founder & Managing Partner",
            "bio": "Gustavo is the Founder and Managing Partner of Forsite Creative. He has worked on approximately 200 projects across Europe, the Middle East, and Africa over the past 12 years of which 10 years in the region.\n \nWith a strategic mind, operational background, and an eye for design; he manages several in-house multi-disciplinary teams (including Research, Data Analytics, Concept Developers, Interior Designers, Branding and Kitchen Designers) for coordinated end-results. \n\nToday Gustavo and his team work together with leading restaurant groups, hotel groups, but also work with real estate developers and government initiatives. \n",
