            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Marketing Manager",
            "bio": "We are proudly the biggest vertical farm in Saudi Arabia.\n\nOur products include Microgreens - Herbs - Lettuces - Leafy Greens - Basils - Salad Mix.\n\nOur products are grown and delivered on the same day, fresh, wonderfully colored that high in antioxidants, and packed full of flavor.\n\nWe are proudly a Saudi made product that is grown in a controlled environment that is entirely hygienic, sealed and monitored, in order to ensure a healthy and a safe product that we are proud to introduce to you.\n\nOffering you solutions on usually imported products in terms of consistency in availability & quality, taking in short notice orders, lower prices, customization on usually standard boxes.\n\nOur products are GMO & Pesticide Free.\n",
