            "company": "Constance Hotels & Resorts",
            "lastname": "Milton ",
            "firstname": "Andrew Simon",
            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Chief Operations Officer",
            "bio": "Andrew Milton, COO of Constance Hotels, Resorts & Golf brings a wealth of experience with over 28 years in the global hospitality industry. \nAndrew is responsible for leading the operations of one of the most prominent hospitality groups in the Indian Ocean region, owning and/or operating seven  luxury hotels under the brand Constance Hotels & Resorts and their first upper upscale hotel under the brand C Resorts in Mauritius, Seychelles, Madagascar and Maldives. \n\nThe group is eager to explore and seize opportunities to extend the market presence of its both its brands and grow its portfolio of managed hotels  by securing hotel management agreements in the Indian Ocean  (Seychelles, Maldives and Mauritius), and seeking opportunities in Asia and the Gulf Cooperation Council region. \n\n",
            "id": 3031366
