            "firstname": "Petra B",
            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Regional Director",
            "bio": "\nPetra has over 18 years’ experience working in the communication industry and media, with immense experience of partnering with luxury brands throughout the region. After working as the brand director for Elle Arab World, leading the full digital transformation of the brand regionally,  Petra moved into consultancy covering 360-degree marketing. She has successfully executed several online platform strategies and set ups, ensuring customer satisfaction. Petra helps brands to grow through clear messaging and right targeting.\n\nPetra is passionate about inspired Leadership and Management; she believes that constantly developing those skills is the strongest argument for every company success. When she is not working, you can find her on the polo field at Al Habtoor Polo Club.\n\nThrough her polo platform and relevant motivational talks, she inspires women of the region to find their own passion and follow it.\n\nPetra is currently leading the Dubai office of Katch International, towards the expansion of prominent markets, working alongside local, regional, and international brands.\n",
            "id": 3032268,
            "country": "AE"
