            "company": "Orbite",
            "lastname": "Gaume",
            "firstname": "Nicolas",
            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Co-Founder, Executive Chairman",
            "bio": "Nicolas Gaume is a French-born entrepreneur whose success has spanned multiple industries. As a long-time space enthusiast, Gaume has focused his energy in the last decade on the commercial space industry. \n\nGaume is co-founder and executive chairman of Orbite, a premier space experience company, which he co-founded alongside US space entrepreneur, Jason Andrews, in 2019. Orbite’s mission is to inspire, equip, and safely prepare the next generation of space travellers to embark on the journey of a lifetime.\n\nGaume is also co-founder and CEO of Space Cargo Unlimited, a European space operator of in-space manufacturing, founded in 2014. \n\nSince 2015, Gaume has held leadership roles at Microsoft. Today, he leads the strategic partnerships and global expansion team for the group technologies and services to the Space industry.\n\nFinally, since 2001, Gaume has been actively involved in his family’s luxury real estate and hospitality activities centered in the Bay of Arcachon, France, which includes boutique Hotel La Co(o)rniche, designed by Philippe Starck. \n\nGaume currently resides in Bordeaux, France with his wife and kids.\n",
            "id": 3032732
