            "bio": "Ramakrishnan, Ram has been working in the region for the last 32 years in general management and financial officer roles with retail , distribution and consumer facing businesses. He was involved in multiple successful franchise operations in the region including Costa, Papa John’s Pizza, Chilis, Burger King, Jamie’s Italian, Dairy Queen, Monsoon Accessories, Mango, Hush Puppies  and several other International brands.\n\n",
