            "firstname": "Jeremy",
            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Chief Executive Officer",
            "bio": "Jeremy is CEO at Keane.  After co-founding the business in the late 1990’s, he has developed it into a leading consultancy with offices in UAE, UK and in KSA (2023). \n\nKeane ‘Consult & Create’ for developers, operators and brands across the globe; creating memorable moments through shaping the offer, brand & environments where people eat, stay, work and shop. Because Experience Matters.\n  \nJeremy has a marketing background, honed in advertising with Saatchi & Saatchi London in the 1990’s and then expanded with commercial roles at Mattel (USA) and international motorsport company, Prodrive, before founding Keane.\n\nHis vision is to develop Keane into a global ‘experience’ consultancy that takes the magic of F&B to create customer engagement across the widest sectors and the furthest continents.\n\nHe is currently engaged on F&B strategy, master-planning and design for many of the 'giga' projects in the Kingdom.\n",
