            "hidden": false,
            "title": "Consultant",
            "bio": "Driven CMO & Consultant with 16 years’ experience in leveraging transformational marketing expertise to develop targeted strategic planning solutions to realise clients’ business objectives. Certified for integration, innovation and strategy by global industry leaders, such as Harvard, Google and Chartered Institute of Marketing.\n\nHis mentorship in CIM as well as his consultancy and leading change qualifications along with disruptive strategy enabled him to transform conventional approaches to a great “Phygital” cutting edge using the best omnichannel practices.\n\nHe has an extensive history of developing cutting-edge marketing solutions for corporate clients within the Proptech, hospitality, real estate, destination marketing and L&E among others.\n",
